# Honest Work "named Humble Merchant" (CR 612.8): the enchanted creature has that name alone, none of the names it had. Under Bot2's
# Opalescence its Room (Roaring Furnace // Steaming Sauna, cast as Roaring Furnace) is a creature, with the name of its unlocked door only. On turn 3
# Bot1 enchants Memnite and then the Room with an Honest Work each, so they are both Humble Merchants and no longer Roaring Furnace, and an Echoing
# Truth on one returns both to Bot2's hand ("all other permanents with that name", CR 201.2) - Opalescence stays. Were the Room still named
# for its door it would stay behind.

